OL,3,GNEWSAResidents demand action over
OL,4,A'Plymouth pongs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocals living near South West Water's
OL,7,FMarsh Mills wastewater treatment works
OL,8,Fclaimed the smells had become worse
OL,9,Fsince the development of a nearby new
OL,10,Ftown, Sherford, which also uses the
OL,11,Ffacility.
OL,13,FSouth West Water has set up an online
OL,14,Ftool for residents to report the odours
OL,15,Fand said it took the matter
OL,16,F"seriously".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
